OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Flight rain moving northwards through
OL,7,Fthe evening, clearing all areas except
OL,8,Fparts of Norfolk by dawn. Dense and
OL,9,Fwidespread fog forming by dawn.
OL,10,FFeeling cool.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA cloudy or foggy start for
OL,13,Fmost. Some light rain across Norfolk,
OL,14,Fwhich may linger during the afternoon.
OL,15,FBrighter spells develop for most areas
OL,16,Fby the afternoon. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
