OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FHigh
OL,6,Fpressure remains dominant. Sunny
OL,7,Fspells, once any morning mist or fog
OL,8,Fclears, on Sunday and Monday. Clear
OL,9,Fstart to Tuesday, clouding over with
OL,10,Frain moving in later.
